{"id":"unabha_ngig","lemma":"unabhängig","pos":"adv","rank":3859,"glosses":["independently, irrespectively, regardless"],"ipa":"/ˈʊn.apˌhɛŋɪç/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e1/De-unabh%C3%A4ngig.ogg/De-unabh%C3%A4ngig.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Bist du unabhängig?","en":"Are you independent?","words":[{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"you"},null]},{"text":"Er ist unabhängig von seinen Eltern.","en":"He is independent of his parents.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"from / of"},{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},{"g":"parents"}]},{"text":"Ich bin ziemlich unabhängig.","en":"I'm very independent.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},{"g":"pretty"},null]},{"text":"Ich bin wirtschaftlich unabhängig von meinen Eltern.","en":"I'm economically independent of my parents.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},{"g":"economical"},null,{"g":"from / of"},{"g":"to opine, to think"},{"g":"parents"}]},{"text":"Sie sind wirtschaftlich unabhängig.","en":"They're self-sufficient.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"economical"},null]}]}